B.a8e=new A.hj("Allah is more pleased with the repentance of His servant than a traveller who finds his lost camel again.","Sahih Muslim 2747 \u2014 summary",!1)
B.a8g=new A.hj("If you did not sin, Allah would replace you with a people who sin, seek forgiveness, and are forgiven.","Sahih Muslim 2749 \u2014 summary",!1)
