B.bEp=new A.eD("The Year of the Elephant","The hour of birth, and the army that could not enter Makkah.")
B.bEj=new A.eD("The Orphan of Makkah","Father gone before birth, mother at six, grandfather at eight \u2014 and yet al-Amin, the trustworthy.")
B.bEk=new A.eD("Al-Amin, The Trustworthy","The title Makkah gave him before revelation \u2014 character precedes the call.")
B.bEh=new A.eD("The Cave of Hira","Forty years old, seeking quiet \u2014 and the first word is Iqra.")
B.bEt=new A.eD("Iqra \u2014 The First Word","Read, in the name of your Lord. The first revelation chose knowledge.")
B.bE9=new A.eD("Three Years of Whispers","Secret teaching, then open call \u2014 patience measured in years.")
B.bEy=new A.eD("Bilal and the Heavy Sand","One word \u2014 Ahad \u2014 heavier than the mountain of sand on his chest.")
B.bEa=new A.eD("The Night of the Journey","From the Haram to Jerusalem to the seven heavens in one night.")
B.bEl=new A.eD("The Boycott","Three years of siege in the valley \u2014 and the believers stayed.")
B.bE7=new A.eD("The First Hijrah","To Abyssinia, where a just king protected the weak \u2014 Musab carried the message.")
B.bEb=new A.eD("The Conversion of Umar","The man who came to kill left proclaiming \u2014 strength that found its direction.")
B.bEd=new A.eD("Taif","Driven to a vineyard outside the city, he prayed to Allah in his weakness and hoped for their descendants.")
B.bEu=new A.eD("The Pledges of Aqabah","The people of Yathrib reach for the Prophet \u2014 a city will be renamed after him.")
B.aC6=s([B.bEp,B.bEj,B.bEk,B.bEh,B.bEt,B.bE9,B.bEy,B.bEa,B.bEl,B.bE7,B.bEb,B.bEd,B.bEu],t.hN)
B.bE6=new A.L8("Makkah \u2014 The Formation","Born in the Year of the Elephant, raised an orphan, trusted before he was believed: the Makkan era forms the man. Read these chapters in order \u2014 each one stands alone, together they are a life.",B.aC6)
B.bEx=new A.eD("The Hijrah","The cave of Thawr: \u201cDo not grieve; indeed Allah is with us\u201d (9:40).")
B.bEm=new A.eD("The Arrival in Madinah","Quba, then the camel that was \u201ccommanded\u201d where to kneel.")
B.bEs=new A.eD("The Charter of Madinah","One document binding Muslims, Jews, and pagans of the city \u2014 the first pluralist charter.")
B.bEr=new A.eD("The Qibla Changes","From Jerusalem to Makkah \u2014 the direction turns, the meaning deepens.")
B.bEf=new A.eD("Badr: The Two Armies Meet","A little over three hundred against some nine hundred to a thousand \u2014 and Allah\u2019s help (3:123-126).")
B.bEv=new A.eD("Badr: The Prisoners","\u201cTreat the prisoners well\u201d \u2014 Ibn Ishaq\u2019s account of the prisoners of Badr.")
B.bEn=new A.eD("Uhud: The Day the Line Broke","Fifty archers told to hold a hill \u2014 and the lesson of obedience cost seventy lives.")
B.bEw=new A.eD("Uhud: Hamza and the Women","The Prophet\u2019s uncle fell; his grief, and the verse that taught patience (16:126).")
B.bEe=new A.eD("The Trench","A city defended with a ditch and words \u2014 Salman\u2019s idea, thirty days of digging.")
B.bEo=new A.eD("Hudaybiyyah","A treaty that looked like surrender \u2014 and a sura that named a clear conquest (48:1).")
B.bEg=new A.eD("Khaybar","After the broken truce, the fortress fell \u2014 and the Prophet ate poisoned food that would carry to his final illness.")
B.bE8=new A.eD("Hunayn and the Return to Taif","Victory over ten thousand at Hunayn, and he went back to the city that stoned him \u2014 to call them again.")
